flowchart LR
    WEB[Web Adapter<br/>Controller / Application Interface]

    subgraph MAIN[交易主链]
        direction LR
        MEMBER[会员与身份] --> CATALOG[商品中心] --> CART[购物车] --> ORDER[订单与结算<br/>交易编排核心]
        ORDER --> STOCK[库存]
        ORDER --> PAY[支付]
        ORDER --> FULFILL[履约物流]
    end

    subgraph GOVERNANCE[治理模块]
        direction TB
        RISK[交易风控]
        AFTER[售后退款]
        JOB[补偿与对账]
        AUDIT[审计与版本]
    end

    subgraph ADAPTERS[外部 Adapter]
        direction TB
        SMS[短信 Adapter]
        MPAY[支付 Adapter]
        LOGI[物流 Adapter]
    end

    WEB --> MEMBER
    WEB --> ORDER
    ORDER --> RISK
    AFTER --> ORDER
    AFTER --> PAY
    JOB --> ORDER
    JOB --> STOCK
    JOB --> PAY
    JOB --> AUDIT

    MEMBER -.-> SMS
    PAY -.-> MPAY
    FULFILL -.-> LOGI
